<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44589" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐοδ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a good journey</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ σοὶ δ᾽ εὐοδίης τρίβον ὄλβιον
					εὔχομαι εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
					1.221
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>: hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐοδίαν ἀπὸ
				στόματος χέειν</span>
			<i>good wishes for one's success</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				36
			</span></i>; personified, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				77
			</span></i> (Alexandria, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ εὐοδίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.27
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. τοῦ ἐλθεῖν</span>
			a <i>good opportunity</i> of coming, <u>PMich.</u> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Class.Phil.</u>
				22.250
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>success</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.Lac.
				1012.47
			</span></i> F., <i><span class="en">
				1429.2
			</span></i> F. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>permeability</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πόρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.86
				</span></i>
			.</div>
